          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Shooting phase, Neyam Shai Murad&apos;s negotiator pistols have a Type of Pistol 4 if she did not move in your preceding Movement phase.</characteristic>
