        <profile name="Concealed Archeotech Weapon" id="7d70-2e19-b0bd-559b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, pick one enemy model within 1&quot; of Janus Draik and roll a dice; on a 4+ the target model suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
