        <profile name="The Third Eye" id="5ea0-2150-4d9d-c698" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When Espern Locarno attempts to manifest the Smite psychic power, select an enemy unit within 12&quot; of and visible to him before making the psychic test - if there are none, he cannot attempt to manifest Smite this phase. If the power is successfully manifested, the unit you chose suffers the mortal wounds, even if another enemy unit is actually closer to Espern Locarno.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
